      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248180999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248184066665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I need to return an item. Order number is VF-881-C2-409.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248189199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly help with that. Let me just pull up that order. One moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248193533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, I'm a bit short on time. Is this going to be a problem or not? Yes or no.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248199133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I see the ClubFit Jersey here. To make sure I process this correctly, what specifically is the issue with the jersey?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248204599997
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size. Simple as that.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248213399997
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. And is it a technical fault with the sizing, or just a preference issue, like it's too tight or too loose?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248215999997
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just too tight across the shoulders. I need to exchange it for the next size up.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248224199997
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for clarifying. That's no problem at all. I see you received the item just a week ago, so it's well within our 90-day policy for a return or exchange. I can process that for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248230066663
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. So what do I do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248243466663
    },
    {
      "text": "I've gone ahead and processed the exchange for a larger size. And since you're a VIP member, I've waived the return shipping fee and upgraded the new jersey to expedited shipping at no cost. You'll get an email with a pre-paid return label in the next few minutes.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248245199996
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect. That's exactly what I needed. Fast and easy.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248262999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy to help. Your new item should be with you in 1-2 business days. Is there anything else I can assist with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248266733329
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's it. Thanks.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58770,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766248274333329
    },
